<title>NETHERLANDS: Philips pledges return to profitability.</title>
<headline>Philips pledges return to profitability.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philips Electronics NV said on Thursday that believed its ongoing businesses would continue to grow and pledged return to profitability.</p>
<p>&quot;Investments in fixed assets and working capital will be tightly controlled,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;We are committed to return to profitability and to the achievement of a positive cash flow of over one billion guilders.&quot;  </p>
<p>&quot;Largely as a result of realignment started in 1996, we expect a small decrease in overall employment,&quot; Philips added.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
